# TR House Telvanni: "The Daedric Septis" (TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q3). Rathra wants the Daedric Septis from the hidden
# Daedric shrine of Rasdamassilu ("Daedric Septis": 10, adds "Rasdamassilu"); handing it over ("I did. I have it
# here." 1) logs 100, and she lets the player keep it.
# PositionCell stands in for the journey through the shrine; the book's ref is 09299D0B (TR_Mainland's slot 09).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_rathra_q2_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_rathra_q3_start
run
player->PositionCell 4123 3980 14430 0 "Tel Ouada, Tower: Rathra's Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rathra"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask chores
ask Daedric Septis
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q3 == 10
bye
end

case ht_rathra_q3_book
run
player->PositionCell 1499 9850 15890 0 "Rasdamassilu, Shrine"
wait 150
take 09299D0B
until 300 player->GetItemCount "T_Bk_UNI_DeadricSeptisTR" >= 1
end

case ht_rathra_q3_done
run
player->PositionCell 4123 3980 14430 0 "Tel Ouada, Tower: Rathra's Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rathra"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask Daedric Septis
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q3 == 100
bye
end
